Hi Team,

As per the GitHub advisory for GHSA-xx22-p4ch-683r (CVE-2026-59949), lz4-ja=
va versions up to and including 1.11.0 are affected, with the issue fixed i=
n version 1.11.1. GitHub Advisory =96 GHSA-xx22-p4ch-683r<https://github.co=
m/advisories/GHSA-xx22-p4ch-683r?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com>

We understand that the latest Kafka version currently uses lz4-java-1.10.2.

Could you please confirm whether this means Kafka is affected by CVE-2026-5=
9949 and whether Kafka needs to be updated to use lz4-java 1.11.1 or later?

If a Kafka update is required, could you also let us know whether there is =
a planned Kafka release that will include the fixed version, and the expect=
ed release date?

Thanks,
James


